// size_Abyx_norms_trfact:  32 × 32 × 4 = 4096 bytes (T matrix)
// size_diag_tmptr:         max(diag, larfb_tmp) = max(1024, 1024×32)×4 ≈ 128 KB
// size_workArr:            batch_ptrs × 2 (for batched)
